"""
bd-verify-cache-pipeline: Automated Verification & Benchmark Harness for Prompt Cache Optimization (R1-R5).

Supports:
  --backends grok,kimi,claude,codex,agy-gemini,agy-claude
  --turns 20
  --json [path]

Acceptance Criteria Enforced:
1. Wire-level prompt cache hit rates on turns 5..20 are >= 99.0% across all platforms.
2. Tool schema serialization diff between consecutive turns is exactly 0 bytes.
3. System preamble token diff contains zero dynamic variables (timestamps, UUIDs, PIDs).
4. Keepalive daemon survives 6-minute simulated tool pause without provider TTL eviction.
5. Telemetry normalized and written to /home/mboyle/bd-persist/accounting/cache_pipeline_verify.tsv (12 columns) and Cockpit compatible.
6. Working tree /home/mboyle/BulkDownloader remains 100% clean (Fleet Rule 22).
7. Returns exit code 0 when all criteria pass.
"""

